    dcterms:description "The 1000 most frequent Swedish nouns, ranked by how often they appear in novels, newspapers and web forums. English on the front, Swedish on the back with its en/ett article. Frequencies from Språkbanken's Flex, word classes from SALDO, translations from Folkets lexikon." ;
